  scenarioDescription: Your study group wants to head to the shopping mall arcade
    and karaoke parlor to celebrate finishing the week.
  options:
  - optionText: Buy a bucket of arcade tokens and two hours of karaoke singing.
    cost: 25
    difficultyLevel: 1
  - optionText: Hang out with the group, purchase a few game tokens, and spectate
      the rest.
    cost: 6
    difficultyLevel: 2
  - optionText: Suggest bringing board games to the community center lounge or school
      courtyard.
    cost: 0
    difficultyLevel: 3
